cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the archived software record and the associated manuscript."
title: "Reproducibility package for One-port Liouvillian sensing: critical dynamics, measurement information, and collective-mode visibility"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: Aishwarya
    family-names: Vishwakarma
    affiliation: "Department of Quantum Matter Physics, University of Geneva"
abstract: >-
  Source code, derived experimental tables, deterministic numerical outputs,
  and figure-generation scripts for the study "One-port Liouvillian sensing:
  critical dynamics, measurement information, and collective-mode visibility".
  The original experimental raw data are referenced by DOI and are not redistributed.
keywords:
  - open quantum systems
  - Liouvillian spectrum
  - quantum sensing
  - exceptional points
  - ESR-STM
  - Floquet dynamics
  - counting statistics
  - spin networks
